{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"b842caeaed820b1509733186fc954ba411c1dca9ce02e60cbb8414f58e38e4ac","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1212},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["会幕的技工"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华晓谕摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「看哪，犹大支派中，户珥的孙子、乌利的儿子比撒列，我已经提他的名召他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我也以我的灵充满了他，使他有智慧，有聪明，有知识，能做各样的工，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["能想出巧工，用金、银、铜制造各物，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又能刻宝石，可以镶嵌，能雕刻木头，能做各样的工。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我分派但支派中、亚希撒抹的儿子亚何利亚伯与他同工。凡心里有智慧的，我更使他们有智慧，能做我一切所吩咐的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["就是会幕和法柜，并其上的施恩座，与会幕中一切的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["桌子和桌子的器具，精金的灯台和灯台的一切器具并香坛，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["燔祭坛和坛的一切器具，并洗濯盆与盆座，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["精工做的礼服，和祭司亚伦并他儿子用以供祭司职分的圣衣，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["膏油和为圣所用馨香的香料。他们都要照我一切所吩咐的去做。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["安息日"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华晓谕摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你要吩咐以色列人说：『你们务要守我的安息日；因为这是你我之间世世代代的证据，使你们知道我—耶和华是叫你们成为圣的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["所以你们要守安息日，以为圣日。凡干犯这日的，必要把他治死；凡在这日做工的，必从民中剪除。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["六日要做工，但第七日是安息圣日，是向耶和华守为圣的。凡在安息日做工的，必要把他治死。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["故此，以色列人要世世代代守安息日为永远的约。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["这是我和以色列人永远的证据；因为六日之内耶和华造天地，第七日便安息舒畅。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和华在西奈山和摩西说完了话，就把两块法版交给他，是 神用指头写的石版。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}